{"seq":2,"slug":"graphsage-gat","title":"GraphSAGE 与图注意力 GAT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graphsage-gat","wordCount":1319,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"graphsage-与图注意力-gat\">GraphSAGE 与图注意力 GAT</h1><p><a href=\"gcn\">GCN</a> 留下了两个洞：它处理不了新来的节点，它对所有邻居一视同仁。2017 年几乎同时出现的两个模型，各补一个洞——GraphSAGE 让 GNN 学会「归纳」，能推广到训练时没见过的节点；GAT 给邻居加注意力，让模型自己决定该听谁的。这两者是工业界用得最多的空间方法，也是 <a href=\"../foundations/message-passing\">消息传递框架</a> 里聚合函数与更新函数两个旋钮各自被拧到极致的范例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-归纳-vs-直推\">核心概念：归纳 vs 直推</h2><p>GCN 的致命问题是<strong>直推式</strong>——它学的是固定图上特定节点的表示。GraphSAGE（SAmple and aggreGatE）换了个思路：不学「节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的表示」，而学「如何从邻居聚合出表示」的<strong>函数</strong>。函数一旦学好，对任何新节点，只要知道它的邻居，就能现场算出表示，这就是<strong>归纳式（inductive）</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 直推式 GCN&#10;    T1[&quot;训练时所有节点在场&quot;] --&gt; T2[&quot;学到固定的节点表示&quot;]&#10;    T2 --&gt; T3[&quot;新节点 → 需重训&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 归纳式 GraphSAGE&#10;    I1[&quot;采样邻居子图&quot;] --&gt; I2[&quot;学聚合函数 AGG&quot;]&#10;    I2 --&gt; I3[&quot;新节点 → 现场聚合即可&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 直推式 GCN\n    T1[\"训练时所有节点在场\"] --&gt; T2[\"学到固定的节点表示\"]\n    T2 --&gt; T3[\"新节点 → 需重训\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 归纳式 GraphSAGE\n    I1[\"采样邻居子图\"] --&gt; I2[\"学聚合函数 AGG\"]\n    I2 --&gt; I3[\"新节点 → 现场聚合即可\"]\n    end</pre><p>两类范式的差异是工业落地的分水岭——电商和社交场景天天有新用户新商品，直推式模型每来一批新节点就要重训，根本不现实。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直推式（GCN）</th>\n<th>归纳式（GraphSAGE/GAT）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习对象</td>\n<td>固定节点的表示</td>\n<td>可复用的聚合函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新节点</td>\n<td>需重新训练</td>\n<td>直接推断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练时图</td>\n<td>必须完整在场</td>\n<td>可用子图/采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工业适用性</td>\n<td>低（图常变）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"graphsage-采样-可学习聚合\">GraphSAGE：采样 + 可学习聚合</h2><p>GraphSAGE 一层做两件事。先<strong>采样</strong>：不取全部邻居，而是固定采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个（比如 25 个），控制计算量与显存——这套采样思想是 <a href=\"../training/neighbor-sampling\">邻居采样与小批量训练</a> 一篇的起点。再<strong>聚合 + 拼接更新</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>CONCAT</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>AGG</mtext><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i^{(l+1)} = \\sigma\\left( W^{(l)} \\cdot \\text{CONCAT}\\left(h_i^{(l)},\\; \\text{AGG}_{j \\in \\mathcal{N}(i)} h_j^{(l)}\\right) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CONCAT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这里和 GCN 的关键区别：GCN 把自身和邻居<strong>混在一起求和</strong>，GraphSAGE 把自身表示和邻居聚合结果<strong>拼接</strong>后再变换，自身信息不会被邻居稀释。聚合函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AGG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AGG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span></span></span></span></span> 有多种选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mean</strong>：邻居表示求平均，最简单。</li>\n<li><strong>Max-pooling</strong>：每个邻居先过一个 MLP，再逐维取最大，能抓显著邻居。</li>\n<li><strong>LSTM</strong>：把邻居随机排序后喂进 LSTM，表达力强但破坏了置换不变性（靠随机化缓解）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每层后通常还做 L2 归一化以稳定训练。GraphSAGE 在 PinSage 中被推到十亿级商品规模，详见 <a href=\"../applications/recommendation-kg\">推荐与知识图谱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gat-让注意力决定邻居权重\">GAT：让注意力决定邻居权重</h2><p>GCN 给邻居的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\tilde{d}_i \\tilde{d}_j}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6747em;vertical-align:-0.8296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4119em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1116em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.4286em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4286em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:1.19em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0836em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4286em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.5429em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.5429em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8296em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是图结构定死的；GAT（Graph Attention Network）的核心洞察是：<strong>不同邻居重要性不同，权重应该由内容学出来</strong>。它给每对相邻节点算一个注意力分数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>LeakyReLU</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{ij} = \\text{LeakyReLU}\\left( a^\\top [W h_i \\,\\|\\, W h_j] \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LeakyReLU</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>再对节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的所有邻居做 softmax 归一化得到注意力权重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{ij} = \\frac{\\exp(e_{ij})}{\\sum_{k \\in \\mathcal{N}(i)} \\exp(e_{ik})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5877em;vertical-align:-1.1607em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1607em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最后加权聚合：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i^{(l+1)} = \\sigma\\left(\\sum_{j \\in \\mathcal{N}(i)} \\alpha_{ij} W h_j\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>GAT 通常用<strong>多头注意力</strong>：并行算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 组独立的注意力再拼接（中间层）或平均（输出层），稳定训练、捕捉多种关系模式——这与 Transformer 的多头思想同源，也为 <a href=\"graph-transformers\">图 Transformer</a> 埋下伏笔。值得一提的是，原始 GAT 的注意力存在「静态」缺陷（最大权重的邻居与查询无关），GATv2（2022）通过调整算子顺序修正了这一点，成为现在的默认实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三者并排对比\">三者并排对比</h2><p>把 GCN、GraphSAGE、GAT 放在 <a href=\"../foundations/message-passing\">消息传递</a> 的同一框架下对比，差异一目了然：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>邻居权重</th>\n<th>是否采样</th>\n<th>归纳?</th>\n<th>自身信息处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GCN</td>\n<td>度数固定</td>\n<td>否（整图）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>加自环混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraphSAGE</td>\n<td>均等（按 AGG）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>拼接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAT</td>\n<td>注意力学习</td>\n<td>否（默认）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>自环也参与注意力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可以看出，它们本质上是在拧 <a href=\"../foundations/message-passing\">消息传递框架</a> 的同几个旋钮：GraphSAGE 拧「聚合 + 采样」，GAT 拧「聚合权重」，更新函数也各有取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么选\">怎么选</h2><p>实践中的选择有套朴素的经验。图会频繁新增节点、或大到必须采样 → 优先 GraphSAGE。节点重要性差异大、需要可解释的邻居权重（注意力可视化）→ 用 GAT/GATv2。图小且固定、要个稳的基线 → GCN 足够。三者也常组合：先 GraphSAGE 采样把图切成小批量，每个小批量内用 GAT 聚合。</p>\n<p>但要警惕：GAT 的注意力虽强，计算和显存开销都比 GCN 大；而无论哪个，叠太多层都逃不过<a href=\"../training/oversmoothing-depth\">过平滑</a>。当图大到连采样都吃力、或需要全局长程依赖时，就该考虑 <a href=\"graph-transformers\">图 Transformer</a> 了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GraphSAGE 把 GCN 的直推式改成归纳式：学的是可复用的聚合函数，对新节点现场聚合即可推断。</li>\n<li>GraphSAGE 用固定数量邻居采样控制开销，并把自身表示与邻居聚合结果<strong>拼接</strong>而非混合。</li>\n<li>GAT 用注意力让邻居权重由内容学出（而非 GCN 的度数固定权重），多头注意力稳定训练，GATv2 修正了静态注意力缺陷。</li>\n<li>三者都是 <a href=\"../foundations/message-passing\">消息传递框架</a> 的特例，区别在聚合/采样/权重旋钮的取舍。</li>\n<li>选型看图是否常变（→SAGE）、邻居是否需差异化加权（→GAT）；都受限于<a href=\"../training/oversmoothing-depth\">过平滑</a>，长程依赖需 <a href=\"graph-transformers\">图 Transformer</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GraphSAGE 与图注意力 GAT","id":"graphsage-与图注意力-gat"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：归纳 vs 直推","id":"核心概念-归纳-vs-直推"},{"level":2,"text":"GraphSAGE：采样 + 可学习聚合","id":"graphsage-采样-可学习聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"GAT：让注意力决定邻居权重","id":"gat-让注意力决定邻居权重"},{"level":2,"text":"三者并排对比","id":"三者并排对比"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么选","id":"怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图卷积网络 GCN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/architectures/gcn"},"next":{"title":"图 Transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graph-transformers"}}